WEB DESIGN AND DEVELOPMENT ASSIGNMENT

Title:
Personal Portfolio Web Page using HTML5 and CSS3

Files:
1. index.html - Main portfolio webpage
2. style.css - Styling and responsive design

How to run:
1. Keep index.html and style.css in the same folder.
2. Double-click index.html, or open it with Google Chrome / Microsoft Edge.
3. The portfolio will open in the browser.

Features:
- HTML5 semantic structure
- CSS3 styling
- Responsive layout for mobile, tablet and desktop
- Navigation menu
- About, Skills, Projects and Contact sections
- Hover effects
- Clean professional design

